Subject: [PATCH] local: keep public-gateway clients working on old browsers

Browser floor for the household (Chrome 111, iOS < 18.4):
- documentpreview bundles pdfjs-dist/legacy (Iterator/Promise.try gap)
- apps/web compat shims Promise.withResolvers/AbortSignal.any pre-119
- webserver boot tail builds its deferred inline (runs before shell)
- settings/src adds settingsNamespace/installSettingsSection so the
  installed @linxin666 entries no longer fail the plugin tree at boot
  (pre-existing local fix, required for dsh-web to start; deduped the
  namespace validator and fixed EOF whitespace for the staged gates)

Local-only commit: preserves these across git pull merges. Agent Notes
